(3744826, 528461, 20168, '<td valign="top">Light according to Einstein is wave and particle, beautifully summed up in this landscape night scene painted with wave particles. The complementary colors of purple and gold add to the magic of this entry. The reflections in the wet sand offer a sense of golden memory.</td>', 'Light according to Einstein is wave and particle, beautifully summed up in this landscape night scene painted with wave particles. The complementary colors of purple and gold add to the magic of this entry. The reflections in the wet sand offer a sense of golden memory.', '2007-06-06 01:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
