(3749118, 528482, 47316, '<td valign="top">I find this to be a really good image. Technically very nice, interesting environment and the lighting and subject are all nice. However I think you killed it with the balls part... seems an attempt at atttention or humor I''m not sure. Fell short of humor with the models lack of reaction... It seems such a serious image and then that... it doesn''t make sense.</td>', 'I find this to be a really good image. Technically very nice, interesting environment and the lighting and subject are all nice. However I think you killed it with the balls part... seems an attempt at atttention or humor I''m not sure. Fell short of humor with the models lack of reaction... It seems such a serious image and then that... it doesn''t make sense.', '2007-06-06 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749125, 529191, 47316, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of light. Think this image would have been more engaging with a human subject, someone playing as a reason for the music to be coming out. I know it would have made the shot more difficult but it would have been worth it I think.</td>', 'Interesting use of light. Think this image would have been more engaging with a human subject, someone playing as a reason for the music to be coming out. I know it would have made the shot more difficult but it would have been worth it I think.', '2007-06-06 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749135, 529194, 47316, '<td valign="top">Beautiful painting. :) Interesting image, makes you think though I''m not really sure I get it. The posisioning and the candles and everything seem strange to me, almost religious. Curious to see how this would look with the model looking at the painting. Also the lighting on the painting is good but the artist falls into the dark where the image becomes full of noise, would much prefer to see him more.</td>', 'Beautiful painting. :) Interesting image, makes you think though I''m not really sure I get it. The posisioning and the candles and everything seem strange to me, almost religious. Curious to see how this would look with the model looking at the painting. Also the lighting on the painting is good but the artist falls into the dark where the image becomes full of noise, would much prefer to see him more.', '2007-06-06 20:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749179, 528813, 45764, '<td valign="top">Good job, even though you can see the "painters" shape in the orange.  8</td>', 'Good job, even though you can see the "painters" shape in the orange.  8', '2007-06-06 20:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749198, 527804, 47316, '<td valign="top">Really interesting image. Curious to know where this is and what''s going on. Not sure I understand what parts were painted with moble light but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Wish the people were a little more lit up.</td>', 'Really interesting image. Curious to know where this is and what''s going on. Not sure I understand what parts were painted with moble light but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt. Wish the people were a little more lit up.', '2007-06-06 20:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749215, 529208, 70891, '<td valign="top">great presentation and finishing.</td>', 'great presentation and finishing.', '2007-06-06 21:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749229, 529183, 54540, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea!  One of my favorites for originality so far!</td>', 'Very clever idea!  One of my favorites for originality so far!', '2007-06-06 21:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749238, 529245, 54540, '<td valign="top">Awesome DNMC tribute!  Extra point for creativity!</td>', 'Awesome DNMC tribute!  Extra point for creativity!', '2007-06-06 21:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
