(3749574, 527099, 60281, '<td valign="top">Would have been better if part of the decanter was not cropped off. It also seems to have a slight tilt to the left.</td>', 'Would have been better if part of the decanter was not cropped off. It also seems to have a slight tilt to the left.', '2007-06-06 22:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
