(3749587, 528801, 60281, '<td valign="top">A nice idea creatively done. The colour balance seems a little magenta to me</td>', 'A nice idea creatively done. The colour balance seems a little magenta to me', '2007-06-06 22:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749603, 529286, 60281, '<td valign="top">Quite well done though I''m struggling to find any connection between the light trails and the fruit. I appreciate that it is abstract but I just don''t seem to be able to connect with it.</td>', 'Quite well done though I''m struggling to find any connection between the light trails and the fruit. I appreciate that it is abstract but I just don''t seem to be able to connect with it.', '2007-06-06 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749616, 529175, 60281, '<td valign="top">I Googled Doppler 8000 and found a weather station called that, so I''m guessing that is what this is. It is an interesting composition, though if it is is a weather station I think it would be interesting to try and catch it with a dramatic weather sky.</td>', 'I Googled Doppler 8000 and found a weather station called that, so I''m guessing that is what this is. It is an interesting composition, though if it is is a weather station I think it would be interesting to try and catch it with a dramatic weather sky.', '2007-06-06 22:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749619, 529151, 70036, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I am sure you havd many tries.  Truly a ''painting''.</td>', 'Excellent.  I am sure you havd many tries.  Truly a ''painting''.', '2007-06-06 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749626, 528683, 60505, '<td valign="top">the parallel lines make this!</td>', 'the parallel lines make this!', '2007-06-06 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749628, 529231, 60281, '<td valign="top">A good image, nice pose. My first thoughts were "too dark" but given time to look I think you have it just right. It has and aged "Old Masters" feel to it. I''m thinking Leonardo Da Vinci. With each passing moment I like this image more. Very well done!</td>', 'A good image, nice pose. My first thoughts were "too dark" but given time to look I think you have it just right. It has and aged "Old Masters" feel to it. I''m thinking Leonardo Da Vinci. With each passing moment I like this image more. Very well done!', '2007-06-06 22:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749635, 527993, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the apple. I don''t think the thing on the left helps the image, I am simply distracted trying to figure out what it is.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the apple. I don''t think the thing on the left helps the image, I am simply distracted trying to figure out what it is.', '2007-06-06 22:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749639, 529191, 60281, '<td valign="top">Well done. This must have been quite tricky to get lined-up. The lighting on the sax is quite good too.</td>', 'Well done. This must have been quite tricky to get lined-up. The lighting on the sax is quite good too.', '2007-06-06 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749646, 529218, 60281, '<td valign="top">Very good! The light coming from the book is very well done. The model is just right too. I like the trees, you have them in just the right tonal zone.</td>', 'Very good! The light coming from the book is very well done. The model is just right too. I like the trees, you have them in just the right tonal zone.', '2007-06-06 22:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749655, 529018, 36006, '<td valign="top">interesting pix.<br/> <br/>did you see the face?</td>', 'interesting pix. did you see the face?', '2007-06-06 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749662, 528131, 60281, '<td valign="top">Looks like quite a place, I will be interested to find out where this is. The lighting is very surreal, the oranges make it seem center of the eath, fiery - Lord of the Rings.</td>', 'Looks like quite a place, I will be interested to find out where this is. The lighting is very surreal, the oranges make it seem center of the eath, fiery - Lord of the Rings.', '2007-06-06 23:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749671, 528536, 60281, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of light, great textures too. The fruit has a softness and the wood a texture that is almost tangible to me.</td>', 'Very nice use of light, great textures too. The fruit has a softness and the wood a texture that is almost tangible to me.', '2007-06-06 23:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749676, 529261, 35613, '<td valign="top">I can''t find a focus point.</td>', 'I can''t find a focus point.', '2007-06-06 23:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749686, 528554, 60281, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a number of images I did of the waterfall by my garden pond. The colours are great and the light following the water flow is a nice idea. Well done.</td>', 'This reminds me of a number of images I did of the waterfall by my garden pond. The colours are great and the light following the water flow is a nice idea. Well done.', '2007-06-06 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749690, 526878, 60281, '<td valign="top">A super image. I particularly like the lighting on (through?) the bowl. Great composition and very well crafted too.</td>', 'A super image. I particularly like the lighting on (through?) the bowl. Great composition and very well crafted too.', '2007-06-06 23:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749705, 528403, 60281, '<td valign="top">This is great! Flyin'' through space in a GTR. Perfect lighting and perfect clarity. Superb choice of composition. One of my favorites.</td>', 'This is great! Flyin'' through space in a GTR. Perfect lighting and perfect clarity. Superb choice of composition. One of my favorites.', '2007-06-06 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749711, 529167, 60281, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. The wine glass is a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice concept. The wine glass is a nice touch.', '2007-06-06 23:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749720, 529321, 60281, '<td valign="top">I like this very much and look forward to finding out haw you did it.</td>', 'I like this very much and look forward to finding out haw you did it.', '2007-06-06 23:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3749900, 529049, 79540, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot. i wish the upper 3rd had a little more light.</td>', 'beautiful shot. i wish the upper 3rd had a little more light.', '2007-06-07 00:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
