(3752762, 528801, 78693, '<td valign="top">Let me tell you why I like this picture.  I love the composition and the blue "steam" that is coming out of the bulb, and guides your eye through the whole picture.  It has a duality on it.  If you pay attention the person seem to have some feminine features. Even though we know is a male because we can see the beard shadow on his upper lip, we can also see very soft and delicate eyes.  Also the hand that is holding the bulb looks very soft and delicate, while the one that holds the bottom part looks more strong and masculine.  I really hope this one gets a ribbon.<br/>Have a great day!</td>', 'Let me tell you why I like this picture.  I love the composition and the blue "steam" that is coming out of the bulb, and guides your eye through the whole picture.  It has a duality on it.  If you pay attention the person seem to have some feminine features. Even though we know is a male because we can see the beard shadow on his upper lip, we can also see very soft and delicate eyes.  Also the hand that is holding the bulb looks very soft and delicate, while the one that holds the bottom part looks more strong and masculine.  I really hope this one gets a ribbon.Have a great day!', '2007-06-07 17:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
