(3752983, 528461, 47316, '<td valign="top">Really cool use of light. Love the reflections on the water. I wonder how this was created. The bright yellow is pretty and contrasts nice with the purple, though it may be interesting to see it with blue tones, not sure. I think where you lose some points is image quality. The rocks in the back in particular seem a little off to me like perhaps they were neatimaged too much but I''m not sure.</td>', 'Really cool use of light. Love the reflections on the water. I wonder how this was created. The bright yellow is pretty and contrasts nice with the purple, though it may be interesting to see it with blue tones, not sure. I think where you lose some points is image quality. The rocks in the back in particular seem a little off to me like perhaps they were neatimaged too much but I''m not sure.', '2007-06-07 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3752995, 528993, 47316, '<td valign="top">kind of interesting as a visual abstract however i think a bit more clarity and image quality would have helped this.</td>', 'kind of interesting as a visual abstract however i think a bit more clarity and image quality would have helped this.', '2007-06-07 18:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753105, 525640, 49804, '<td valign="top">absolutely awesome shot, love the use of the light, 9 from me</td>', 'absolutely awesome shot, love the use of the light, 9 from me', '2007-06-07 19:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753882, 526659, 54446, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge!  Superb backlighting.  Genius idea!</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge!  Superb backlighting.  Genius idea!', '2007-06-07 21:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753885, 528601, 62787, '<td valign="top">Heh, I''ve got a real fire whip that I use for performances, so I can''t help but laugh :)<br/>(it looks like <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=492940" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a>)<br/> <br/>Cool picture, very nicely done. The pose and facial expression are good. Objections: The highlights of the flames are a bit burnt out in places. You can prevent that by either moving the fire very quickly, or using a tiny aperture (and having a very strong light pointed at the subject at the beginning). Also, I think it''s a shame that you''re not holding some sort of handle that the fire could seem to be attached to (at the moment it''s just hovering in mid-air, so the illusion isn''t complete), and it would have worked better if you hadn''t cut off the top of the flame. Still a very good shot though - I know how difficult fire-painting is!</td>', 'Heh, I''ve got a real fire whip that I use for performances, so I can''t help but laugh :)(it looks like this) Cool picture, very nicely done. The pose and facial expression are good. Objections: The highlights of the flames are a bit burnt out in places. You can prevent that by either moving the fire very quickly, or using a tiny aperture (and having a very strong light pointed at the subject at the beginning). Also, I think it''s a shame that you''re not holding some sort of handle that the fire could seem to be attached to (at the moment it''s just hovering in mid-air, so the illusion isn''t complete), and it would have worked better if you hadn''t cut off the top of the flame. Still a very good shot though - I know how difficult fire-painting is!', '2007-06-07 21:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753894, 529191, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite in this challenge.  Absolutely superb and enjoyable to view (and "hear").  This deserves to win this challenge.  Hope to see a blue ribbon for this for you.</td>', 'This is my favorite in this challenge.  Absolutely superb and enjoyable to view (and "hear").  This deserves to win this challenge.  Hope to see a blue ribbon for this for you.', '2007-06-07 21:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753912, 528874, 40355, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this is so blurred that it is impossible to determine what it is a photo of.  In addition, appears to have a negligible painted-light effect.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this is so blurred that it is impossible to determine what it is a photo of.  In addition, appears to have a negligible painted-light effect.', '2007-06-07 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753914, 528378, 47316, '<td valign="top">not sure what to say about this one. I can''t really tell whats going on I guess. Looks like a hanging lamp. Would like to see the line of light go from one end to the other to convey the swing of the pendulum</td>', 'not sure what to say about this one. I can''t really tell whats going on I guess. Looks like a hanging lamp. Would like to see the line of light go from one end to the other to convey the swing of the pendulum', '2007-06-07 21:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3753923, 528482, 62787, '<td valign="top">Someone other than me is submitting fire-spinning shots to DPC? :) Damn you, competition!<br/> <br/>Very nicely done - the background is cool, the posture and facial expression are great. You got some nice detail in the flames too. Slightly distracting white bits in the top right, but nothing you can really fix in basic editing. I look forward to finding out who this is by :)</td>', 'Someone other than me is submitting fire-spinning shots to DPC? :) Damn you, competition! Very nicely done - the background is cool, the posture and facial expression are great. You got some nice detail in the flames too. Slightly distracting white bits in the top right, but nothing you can really fix in basic editing. I look forward to finding out who this is by :)', '2007-06-07 21:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
