(3757849, 529183, 74534, '<td valign="top">Hey - cool idea. How about if the light was directed at the roots of the plants instead? Also, the "green thingy" (sorry, don''t know the word) look s a bit bland and uninteresting - maybe crop more of it?</td>', 'Hey - cool idea. How about if the light was directed at the roots of the plants instead? Also, the "green thingy" (sorry, don''t know the word) look s a bit bland and uninteresting - maybe crop more of it?', '2007-06-08 16:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757852, 529308, 74534, '<td valign="top">The rays of light are very cool, but I don''t understand what the "thingy-on-a-stick" in the middle is, or what it''s doing there.</td>', 'The rays of light are very cool, but I don''t understand what the "thingy-on-a-stick" in the middle is, or what it''s doing there.', '2007-06-08 16:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757858, 529224, 74534, '<td valign="top">Cool "planetoid" shot, but the yellow part is a bit distracting. I think it either needs something interesting in the middle of the "orbit" or, if you want the black hole look, more light around it.</td>', 'Cool "planetoid" shot, but the yellow part is a bit distracting. I think it either needs something interesting in the middle of the "orbit" or, if you want the black hole look, more light around it.', '2007-06-08 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757866, 528020, 74534, '<td valign="top">That''s a good idea, but the hand is fuzzy due to the long exposure. Lighting the hand only briefly with a flash would have solved this, but the light would have had a different color. Fairly complicated image :)</td>', 'That''s a good idea, but the hand is fuzzy due to the long exposure. Lighting the hand only briefly with a flash would have solved this, but the light would have had a different color. Fairly complicated image :)', '2007-06-08 16:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757871, 528554, 74534, '<td valign="top">Uhh... the first contender I encounter in this challenge. Can''t find any fault. Light, composition, lines, colors - everything is very well done. It''s a bit oversaturated, but for some reason even that works well.</td>', 'Uhh... the first contender I encounter in this challenge. Can''t find any fault. Light, composition, lines, colors - everything is very well done. It''s a bit oversaturated, but for some reason even that works well.', '2007-06-08 16:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757875, 529261, 74534, '<td valign="top">Took me a second to see where the "painting with light" was done. Good idea, but it doesn''t stand out against the "rubble" as much as it should.</td>', 'Took me a second to see where the "painting with light" was done. Good idea, but it doesn''t stand out against the "rubble" as much as it should.', '2007-06-08 16:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757878, 527354, 74534, '<td valign="top">So unless you have one POWERFUL flashlight, I assume only the rock was light-painted :) It''s a very beautiful image, but the rock isn''t an interesting enough subject. Maybe take advantage of the "paint" part and try to light it up more creatively? A high score from me anyway.</td>', 'So unless you have one POWERFUL flashlight, I assume only the rock was light-painted :) It''s a very beautiful image, but the rock isn''t an interesting enough subject. Maybe take advantage of the "paint" part and try to light it up more creatively? A high score from me anyway.', '2007-06-08 16:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757883, 527631, 74534, '<td valign="top">This image is very powerful. The dark-red-on-black gives it a strong feeling. I wonder about a different composition, with the face slightly tilted to one side maybe, to make it more interesting.</td>', 'This image is very powerful. The dark-red-on-black gives it a strong feeling. I wonder about a different composition, with the face slightly tilted to one side maybe, to make it more interesting.', '2007-06-08 16:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757889, 528396, 74534, '<td valign="top">This image is good, but it could have been exceptional, ribbon winner! First of all - so small! Second, not that I''m asking for absolute sharpness for the sake of it, but it is a bit too fuzzy. However - great idea, very good execution, and above all EXCEPTIONAL lighting, with both face and silhouette!</td>', 'This image is good, but it could have been exceptional, ribbon winner! First of all - so small! Second, not that I''m asking for absolute sharpness for the sake of it, but it is a bit too fuzzy. However - great idea, very good execution, and above all EXCEPTIONAL lighting, with both face and silhouette!', '2007-06-08 16:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757896, 529293, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good execution and pleasing colors, but somehow lacks interest... Very good idea, maybe a different composition? Also, a tighter crop vertically?</td>', 'Very good execution and pleasing colors, but somehow lacks interest... Very good idea, maybe a different composition? Also, a tighter crop vertically?', '2007-06-08 16:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3757905, 527768, 74534, '<td valign="top">Gotta wonder why those three keys in particular. The lighting is good, and the image is sharp and contrasty and with pleasing color, but I feel like I''m missing a message here.</td>', 'Gotta wonder why those three keys in particular. The lighting is good, and the image is sharp and contrasty and with pleasing color, but I feel like I''m missing a message here.', '2007-06-08 16:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
