(3760837, 529177, 3080, '<td valign="top">It bugs me that it looks like the glass is tilting. Almost like it''s going to fall over.  The bottle is nice and straight, but the angle I think is what makes the glass look odd.  Background is very nice for the photo, I like the lighting in the background.  The painting with light looks a little sloppy, and unorganized, but serves the purpose well.  I wonder if it would have more impact if someone were pouring the light out of the bottle, as it doesn''t make much sense for it to be jumping out of the bottle into the glass on it''s own.  Focus and clarity are very good.</td>', 'It bugs me that it looks like the glass is tilting. Almost like it''s going to fall over.  The bottle is nice and straight, but the angle I think is what makes the glass look odd.  Background is very nice for the photo, I like the lighting in the background.  The painting with light looks a little sloppy, and unorganized, but serves the purpose well.  I wonder if it would have more impact if someone were pouring the light out of the bottle, as it doesn''t make much sense for it to be jumping out of the bottle into the glass on it''s own.  Focus and clarity are very good.', '2007-06-09 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760841, 529299, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, I love how the flower stands out with the lighting.  The background compliments the subject very well.  Focus and clarity are great.  I love how it''s dark but for the flower.  Makes it stand out wonderfully.  There is nothing about this photo that I don''t like.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Very pretty, I love how the flower stands out with the lighting.  The background compliments the subject very well.  Focus and clarity are great.  I love how it''s dark but for the flower.  Makes it stand out wonderfully.  There is nothing about this photo that I don''t like.  Excellent job.', '2007-06-09 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760853, 529231, 3080, '<td valign="top">This seems too dark for me.  Hard to tell that the light has been ''painted'' on or if it''s just a stationary light source.  i like the pose, and it''s very tastefully done, only wish that the subject were a bit brighter.  would love to see this in more detail.</td>', 'This seems too dark for me.  Hard to tell that the light has been ''painted'' on or if it''s just a stationary light source.  i like the pose, and it''s very tastefully done, only wish that the subject were a bit brighter.  would love to see this in more detail.', '2007-06-09 18:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760856, 525804, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the lighting and colors here  but wonder if it would look better with a tighter crop</td>', 'i like the lighting and colors here  but wonder if it would look better with a tighter crop', '2007-06-09 18:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760858, 528536, 67152, '<td valign="top">the glow of this is really awesome - the colors seem to really jump off the screen</td>', 'the glow of this is really awesome - the colors seem to really jump off the screen', '2007-06-09 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760863, 529286, 3080, '<td valign="top">:) I like it.  I like the lighting on the pears as well as the painted lighting above.  You did an excellent job with the lighting on this one.  Focus and clarity are also perfect.  Nothing to complain about here.  Very nice.</td>', ':) I like it.  I like the lighting on the pears as well as the painted lighting above.  You did an excellent job with the lighting on this one.  Focus and clarity are also perfect.  Nothing to complain about here.  Very nice.', '2007-06-09 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760866, 528970, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice night shot - the lighting on the trees adds some nice contrast to the image</td>', 'nice night shot - the lighting on the trees adds some nice contrast to the image', '2007-06-09 18:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760873, 528891, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what I''m looking at here.  There is nothing that catches my eye as interesting.  my eyes wander around looking for the point of the image.  the color is ok, but the photo in general is lacking something to hold my interest. sorry if i''m missing something.</td>', 'Not really sure what I''m looking at here.  There is nothing that catches my eye as interesting.  my eyes wander around looking for the point of the image.  the color is ok, but the photo in general is lacking something to hold my interest. sorry if i''m missing something.', '2007-06-09 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760876, 524848, 67152, '<td valign="top">pretty colors but the image seems to lack some really sharp details</td>', 'pretty colors but the image seems to lack some really sharp details', '2007-06-09 18:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760883, 524818, 67152, '<td valign="top">cool lighting on the face - but there is a little bit too much noise</td>', 'cool lighting on the face - but there is a little bit too much noise', '2007-06-09 18:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760884, 528801, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love the point of this.  The lack of focus in the hands really draws my attention downward away from the most interesting part of the image.  Since the hands are brighter than the face, that''s where my eyes go, and the face area is a more interesting section.  Very neat concept for the photo, and well executed.</td>', 'Love the point of this.  The lack of focus in the hands really draws my attention downward away from the most interesting part of the image.  Since the hands are brighter than the face, that''s where my eyes go, and the face area is a more interesting section.  Very neat concept for the photo, and well executed.', '2007-06-09 18:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760885, 528398, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the low key lighting  6</td>', 'love the low key lighting  6', '2007-06-09 18:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760892, 528034, 3080, '<td valign="top">not sure what this is, and it''s hard to tell that it was painted with light.  I think maybe there could be a more interesting crop or way of displaying this.  upper left corner is dark, causing a distraction.  nothing to really hold my interest for long.  crop is too tight around the subject and subject is too centered.  overall lacking in the ''wow'' department.</td>', 'not sure what this is, and it''s hard to tell that it was painted with light.  I think maybe there could be a more interesting crop or way of displaying this.  upper left corner is dark, causing a distraction.  nothing to really hold my interest for long.  crop is too tight around the subject and subject is too centered.  overall lacking in the ''wow'' department.', '2007-06-09 18:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760894, 526494, 67152, '<td valign="top">really nice photo - illuminating the move is really well done - and the image is so sharp in focus with such good contrast and levels - 10</td>', 'really nice photo - illuminating the move is really well done - and the image is so sharp in focus with such good contrast and levels - 10', '2007-06-09 18:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760895, 528813, 67152, '<td valign="top">this is just awesome - the sky is fabulous - the tree is ''dream like'' and the notes are just too cool for school- 10</td>', 'this is just awesome - the sky is fabulous - the tree is ''dream like'' and the notes are just too cool for school- 10', '2007-06-09 18:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760896, 528132, 67152, '<td valign="top">this is really well done - love the light painting - the focus on the vase is outstanding - great work -10</td>', 'this is really well done - love the light painting - the focus on the vase is outstanding - great work -10', '2007-06-09 18:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760897, 528482, 67152, '<td valign="top">a little bit rude - but very well captured - the light ring is very good and the lighting on his face is really smartly done - 9</td>', 'a little bit rude - but very well captured - the light ring is very good and the lighting on his face is really smartly done - 9', '2007-06-09 18:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760898, 528973, 67152, '<td valign="top">love the warmth and glow created by the light - it seems to be coming from everywhere -9</td>', 'love the warmth and glow created by the light - it seems to be coming from everywhere -9', '2007-06-09 18:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760899, 528363, 67152, '<td valign="top">the colors and tones are awesome in this - it almost looks like the light is coming from within.</td>', 'the colors and tones are awesome in this - it almost looks like the light is coming from within.', '2007-06-09 18:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760910, 528391, 3080, '<td valign="top">nothing really impressive here photographically.  Could have just as easily been a screen shot off a computer or something.  Not really sure where the painting with light was used to make this creative or interesting.  I think in order to appreciate this image, one would probably have to have seen the set up and execution.  It''s just not capturing my interest.</td>', 'nothing really impressive here photographically.  Could have just as easily been a screen shot off a computer or something.  Not really sure where the painting with light was used to make this creative or interesting.  I think in order to appreciate this image, one would probably have to have seen the set up and execution.  It''s just not capturing my interest.', '2007-06-09 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3760944, 528132, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I was beginning to think that people were not understanding the whole painting with light idea.  very nicely executed. love the color and the overall placement of the subject is very good. nothing to complain about here.</td>', 'Excellent.  I was beginning to think that people were not understanding the whole painting with light idea.  very nicely executed. love the color and the overall placement of the subject is very good. nothing to complain about here.', '2007-06-09 18:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
