(3763239, 527768, 77315, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but a higher apperture would have been better, as the keys in the right is out of focus</td>', 'Very nice, but a higher apperture would have been better, as the keys in the right is out of focus', '2007-06-10 14:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763621, 527354, 70270, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful ... well composed, perfectly exposed for both the rich silhouettes of the trees and the soft reflections in the water.  The use of a flashlight (?) to brighten the rock adds foreground interest and pulls everything together.  Anyone who questions whether this is painting with light is simply out of their mind.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful ... well composed, perfectly exposed for both the rich silhouettes of the trees and the soft reflections in the water.  The use of a flashlight (?) to brighten the rock adds foreground interest and pulls everything together.  Anyone who questions whether this is painting with light is simply out of their mind.', '2007-06-10 17:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763624, 528381, 70270, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job painting the flower, nice soft shadows and highlight details.</td>', 'Beautiful job painting the flower, nice soft shadows and highlight details.', '2007-06-10 17:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763626, 529304, 70270, '<td valign="top">Love the soft light on this and the variable patterns of light on the petals, almost looks like it was shot underwater.</td>', 'Love the soft light on this and the variable patterns of light on the petals, almost looks like it was shot underwater.', '2007-06-10 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763629, 528693, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I hope it scores well.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I hope it scores well.', '2007-06-10 17:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763714, 527207, 26559, '<td valign="top">Does not seem to meet the challenge</td>', 'Does not seem to meet the challenge', '2007-06-10 17:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763721, 527780, 26559, '<td valign="top">Looks like a snapshot?</td>', 'Looks like a snapshot?', '2007-06-10 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763728, 528323, 26559, '<td valign="top">Very underexposed</td>', 'Very underexposed', '2007-06-10 17:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763804, 529077, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light on the orange flower; well saturated colors</td>', 'Nice soft light on the orange flower; well saturated colors', '2007-06-10 18:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763806, 526659, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cool idea ... sparklers behind the tea pot?  I would have liked just a tad more light on the face of the pot, or seen the whole thing go to black as a silhouette.  Looks kind of in between here.  Still, one of the better shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Cool idea ... sparklers behind the tea pot?  I would have liked just a tad more light on the face of the pot, or seen the whole thing go to black as a silhouette.  Looks kind of in between here.  Still, one of the better shots in the challenge.', '2007-06-10 18:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763810, 529239, 70270, '<td valign="top">I like the blue cast the light gives to this, with the red light coming through the windows.  Still trying to figure out if the wraith by the door is you lighting the structure of something else ...</td>', 'I like the blue cast the light gives to this, with the red light coming through the windows.  Still trying to figure out if the wraith by the door is you lighting the structure of something else ...', '2007-06-10 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763815, 529151, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting on the three foreground flowers.  Could have used just a bit more painting on the purple flower, which fades into the background just a tad too much, imo.</td>', 'Nice lighting on the three foreground flowers.  Could have used just a bit more painting on the purple flower, which fades into the background just a tad too much, imo.', '2007-06-10 18:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763818, 528554, 70270, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting, definitely evokes the sense of enchantment you were going for.  A bit oversaturated or oversharpened, perhaps?  Has the feel of a little too much processing.</td>', 'Cool lighting, definitely evokes the sense of enchantment you were going for.  A bit oversaturated or oversharpened, perhaps?  Has the feel of a little too much processing.', '2007-06-10 18:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763826, 528693, 70270, '<td valign="top">Interesting image ... appears that model is lit with light filtering through something like a venetian blind rather than with a handheld moving light source, but still an interesting graphic effect.</td>', 'Interesting image ... appears that model is lit with light filtering through something like a venetian blind rather than with a handheld moving light source, but still an interesting graphic effect.', '2007-06-10 18:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763830, 529304, 4162, '<td valign="top">WOW! This is the technique used to perfection-IMO...10</td>', 'WOW! This is the technique used to perfection-IMO...10', '2007-06-10 18:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763831, 527528, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a mobile light to illuminate the foreground, but the subject as a whole lacks dramatic interest for me.</td>', 'Nice use of a mobile light to illuminate the foreground, but the subject as a whole lacks dramatic interest for me.', '2007-06-10 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763841, 524654, 4162, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is used beautifully-gorgeous..9</td>', 'The lighting here is used beautifully-gorgeous..9', '2007-06-10 18:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763843, 524822, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and shadow play, brings out the textures and detail very well.</td>', 'Nice lighting and shadow play, brings out the textures and detail very well.', '2007-06-10 18:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763847, 529287, 4162, '<td valign="top">10=perfect!</td>', '10=perfect!', '2007-06-10 18:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763852, 526617, 70270, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure of the nighttime sky and use of a flashlight to illuminate the far shore.  I would have cropped off the bottom fourth of the picture, from about where that rock juts out to the lefthand shore, as there''s not a lot of foreground interest there, and I think that detracts somewhat from the composition.</td>', 'Nice exposure of the nighttime sky and use of a flashlight to illuminate the far shore.  I would have cropped off the bottom fourth of the picture, from about where that rock juts out to the lefthand shore, as there''s not a lot of foreground interest there, and I think that detracts somewhat from the composition.', '2007-06-10 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763937, 527777, 902, '<td valign="top">Very cool</td>', 'Very cool', '2007-06-10 18:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3763946, 528502, 902, '<td valign="top">Sorry, just didn''t work for me.  To me it looks like an out of focus cell phone.</td>', 'Sorry, just didn''t work for me.  To me it looks like an out of focus cell phone.', '2007-06-10 18:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3764232, 526878, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very smart selection for a vase and then the ambient lighting adds to the beauty.</td>', 'A very smart selection for a vase and then the ambient lighting adds to the beauty.', '2007-06-10 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1);
