(3769084, 528829, 74534, '<td valign="top">The concept (while not unique) is well-executed. I particularly like the light in the bucket (but not the flare is creates). The painter''s t-shirt though captures way too much attention.</td>', 'The concept (while not unique) is well-executed. I particularly like the light in the bucket (but not the flare is creates). The painter''s t-shirt though captures way too much attention.', '2007-06-11 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
