(3769712, 529084, 43073, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot; extremely subtle, with a lovely image to support the good use of the painted light. Not overdone, nicely composed, very possibly my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot; extremely subtle, with a lovely image to support the good use of the painted light. Not overdone, nicely composed, very possibly my favorite of the challenge.', '2007-06-11 19:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769715, 528745, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent image, with lots of interesting elements to it; good take on the challenge and nice execution. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Excellent image, with lots of interesting elements to it; good take on the challenge and nice execution. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-11 19:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769718, 528582, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great shot, absolutely perfect, the subtle use of the painted light, the wonderful B&amp;W, the details and lovely tones throughout. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Great shot, absolutely perfect, the subtle use of the painted light, the wonderful B&W, the details and lovely tones throughout. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-11 19:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769723, 529218, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent image. Great concept and wonderful execution, from composition to exposure, to support the innovative use of the painted light. One of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent image. Great concept and wonderful execution, from composition to exposure, to support the innovative use of the painted light. One of my top picks for the challenge.', '2007-06-11 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769724, 529099, 43073, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this, with the painted light as an element but just one element of the whole image. Nice tones on the B&amp;W, and good shadows and composition. One of my top picks.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this, with the painted light as an element but just one element of the whole image. Nice tones on the B&W, and good shadows and composition. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-11 19:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769728, 529145, 43073, '<td valign="top">Great concept wonderfully executed; great exposure and composition, and wonderfully unique use of painted light. One of my top picks.</td>', 'Great concept wonderfully executed; great exposure and composition, and wonderfully unique use of painted light. One of my top picks.', '2007-06-11 19:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769729, 528482, 43073, '<td valign="top">Excellent image supporting the great use of painted light here; I really like this shot (one of my top picks of the challenge); well conceived and executed, with good exposure, setting and composition.</td>', 'Excellent image supporting the great use of painted light here; I really like this shot (one of my top picks of the challenge); well conceived and executed, with good exposure, setting and composition.', '2007-06-11 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769732, 527911, 43073, '<td valign="top">I love this; the light and shadows play perfectly across the model, and the pose, composition and tones are wonderful. One of my top picks of the challenge.</td>', 'I love this; the light and shadows play perfectly across the model, and the pose, composition and tones are wonderful. One of my top picks of the challenge.', '2007-06-11 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769735, 526659, 43073, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few "bright light" images that ranked at the top for me; the use of the sparks to backlight the kettle, but also including them coming out of the spout, was perfect. Lighting and composition appropriate to the subject, this is one of my top picks of the challenge.</td>', 'This is one of the few "bright light" images that ranked at the top for me; the use of the sparks to backlight the kettle, but also including them coming out of the spout, was perfect. Lighting and composition appropriate to the subject, this is one of my top picks of the challenge.', '2007-06-11 19:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769737, 528196, 43073, '<td valign="top">I loved this, and your take on the challenge, the first time I saw it; such wonderful tones and shades throughout. I wish this place didn''t force such an awkward title on such an interesting shot, but I understand why you titled it as you did.</td>', 'I loved this, and your take on the challenge, the first time I saw it; such wonderful tones and shades throughout. I wish this place didn''t force such an awkward title on such an interesting shot, but I understand why you titled it as you did.', '2007-06-11 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769739, 528870, 43073, '<td valign="top">Wonderful choices made here, with the horizontal lines the perfect way to paint these objects with light. Delightful.</td>', 'Wonderful choices made here, with the horizontal lines the perfect way to paint these objects with light. Delightful.', '2007-06-11 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769740, 528886, 43073, '<td valign="top">Each time I see this, I bumped it up another point. I thought I was done, but when I came back to write a comment, here I am, bumping it up again. At least now I can''t bump it any more ;) I like this, though, for the wonderful feeling it evokes from effective use of the painted light technique. It feels clean and fresh. Wonderful.</td>', 'Each time I see this, I bumped it up another point. I thought I was done, but when I came back to write a comment, here I am, bumping it up again. At least now I can''t bump it any more ;) I like this, though, for the wonderful feeling it evokes from effective use of the painted light technique. It feels clean and fresh. Wonderful.', '2007-06-11 19:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769744, 527914, 29591, '<td valign="top">I can see some expression on her face however it is too dark to see more and this shot leaves me wanting for more. The darkness on her face looks more accidental than on purpose to me.</td>', 'I can see some expression on her face however it is too dark to see more and this shot leaves me wanting for more. The darkness on her face looks more accidental than on purpose to me.', '2007-06-11 19:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769747, 526246, 43073, '<td valign="top">Something about this image just called to me from the first time I saw it; I thought at first it was under water, but the shades and clarity undermine that; in any event, I love the choice of objects here, and the use of the lighting to highlight them and draw in the viewer''s attention, with lots to see here. Excellent image.</td>', 'Something about this image just called to me from the first time I saw it; I thought at first it was under water, but the shades and clarity undermine that; in any event, I love the choice of objects here, and the use of the lighting to highlight them and draw in the viewer''s attention, with lots to see here. Excellent image.', '2007-06-11 19:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3769752, 529287, 29591, '<td valign="top">Now this is very nice, however I would prefer a bit more detail in the first mandolin. As it is seems more like a black spot than your subject. Just a bit of light would have make such a difference IMHO</td>', 'Now this is very nice, however I would prefer a bit more detail in the first mandolin. As it is seems more like a black spot than your subject. Just a bit of light would have make such a difference IMHO', '2007-06-11 20:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
