(3769759, 525909, 29591, '<td valign="top">IMHO the out of focus looks more off than just shallow dof. maybe the light wasn''t strong enough to get a wow factor from the glass''s decorations.</td>', 'IMHO the out of focus looks more off than just shallow dof. maybe the light wasn''t strong enough to get a wow factor from the glass''s decorations.', '2007-06-11 20:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
