(3769772, 528716, 29591, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but it has been done before and a bit better IMHO For me it is distracting that the white line doesn''t ends in the point of your brush and a white line coming from a black brush is also weird. However I have to say that overall it was a good attempt. keep working hard on your skills!</td>', 'Nice idea but it has been done before and a bit better IMHO For me it is distracting that the white line doesn''t ends in the point of your brush and a white line coming from a black brush is also weird. However I have to say that overall it was a good attempt. keep working hard on your skills!', '2007-06-11 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
