(3769775, 528821, 29591, '<td valign="top">The light gives it some motion but it still lacks something I can''t pinpoint. Love the bright spot just between the driver and ball.</td>', 'The light gives it some motion but it still lacks something I can''t pinpoint. Love the bright spot just between the driver and ball.', '2007-06-11 20:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
