(3772815, 528582, 31403, '<td valign="top">wow.<br/> <br/>wow.<br/> <br/>this is just stunning.  Not only the best in this challenge - but the best I''ve seen in a long time.  This is what light painting is all about.  Beautiful subtlety - truly what I was going for with mine but executed flawlessly here.<br/> <br/>amazing work.</td>', 'wow. wow. this is just stunning.  Not only the best in this challenge - but the best I''ve seen in a long time.  This is what light painting is all about.  Beautiful subtlety - truly what I was going for with mine but executed flawlessly here. amazing work.', '2007-06-12 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773021, 528536, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice job with this still life.  I like your choice in wood to use also, the texture really adds to this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice job with this still life.  I like your choice in wood to use also, the texture really adds to this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-06-12 14:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773034, 528322, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever.  I like the way you''ve put this together.  Only nit (minor) from me is it might be a tad better if the bottom loops weren''t quite so loose, but tough to do I''m sure.  Overall, very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Clever.  I like the way you''ve put this together.  Only nit (minor) from me is it might be a tad better if the bottom loops weren''t quite so loose, but tough to do I''m sure.  Overall, very nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-06-12 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773041, 528886, 30049, '<td valign="top">Great choice of color to make your subject stand out yet have nice interest with the "light painting".  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Great choice of color to make your subject stand out yet have nice interest with the "light painting".  Well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-06-12 14:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773047, 528874, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract photo.  Not quite sure where the painting with light is in this, however, it certainly is fun to look at.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract photo.  Not quite sure where the painting with light is in this, however, it certainly is fun to look at.  :)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-06-12 14:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773055, 529304, 67697, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous illumination!</td>', 'Gorgeous illumination!', '2007-06-12 14:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
