(3773164, 528973, 71931, '<td valign="top">Exquisite chiaroscuro isn''t "painting with light", as such, even though it is.  Lots of really nice photos in this got low marks from me, as I didn''t think that they were on the topic.  But this is still a really nice photo :-)</td>', 'Exquisite chiaroscuro isn''t "painting with light", as such, even though it is.  Lots of really nice photos in this got low marks from me, as I didn''t think that they were on the topic.  But this is still a really nice photo :-)', '2007-06-12 14:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773170, 528974, 71931, '<td valign="top">Talk about being in the right place at the right time...!</td>', 'Talk about being in the right place at the right time...!', '2007-06-12 14:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773176, 528678, 71931, '<td valign="top">When the topic calls for a moving light source...  A nice shot, but not on the theme.</td>', 'When the topic calls for a moving light source...  A nice shot, but not on the theme.', '2007-06-12 14:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773235, 528648, 38930, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Nice job!</td>', 'Wow.  Nice job!', '2007-06-12 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773287, 527159, 38930, '<td valign="top">awesome!!</td>', 'awesome!!', '2007-06-12 15:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773329, 528974, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fantastic idea and a great shot, I just would suggest one thing as a possible improvement - if this is cropped, that the crop not be so tight that the main subject feels "hemmed in" on all sides.</td>', 'I think this is a fantastic idea and a great shot, I just would suggest one thing as a possible improvement - if this is cropped, that the crop not be so tight that the main subject feels "hemmed in" on all sides.', '2007-06-12 15:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773344, 529025, 61651, '<td valign="top">"was a good friend of mine..." - now I''m going to have that song in my head all day. :)  Cute idea, for my own preferences, I would have liked to see more space on the left and bottom of the frog, and have the frog better lit to see more detail, although I imagine that might be difficult to do along with the light effects.</td>', '"was a good friend of mine..." - now I''m going to have that song in my head all day. :)  Cute idea, for my own preferences, I would have liked to see more space on the left and bottom of the frog, and have the frog better lit to see more detail, although I imagine that might be difficult to do along with the light effects.', '2007-06-12 15:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773420, 528536, 71931, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer shots that not really on the theme...</td>', 'One of the nicer shots that not really on the theme...', '2007-06-12 16:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773522, 528235, 67697, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Great way to use the light to tell a story.</td>', 'Cute!  Great way to use the light to tell a story.', '2007-06-12 16:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773525, 525640, 67697, '<td valign="top">Great perspective.</td>', 'Great perspective.', '2007-06-12 16:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773527, 529169, 67697, '<td valign="top">Good straight lines and lovely red glow.  Nice lighting on the balls.</td>', 'Good straight lines and lovely red glow.  Nice lighting on the balls.', '2007-06-12 16:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773533, 528185, 67697, '<td valign="top">Pretty and great closeup.  Nice detail on the flower.</td>', 'Pretty and great closeup.  Nice detail on the flower.', '2007-06-12 16:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
