(3773540, 529092, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and pretty subject.  I''d like to see a little more painted light to increase the contrast.</td>', 'Nice idea and pretty subject.  I''d like to see a little more painted light to increase the contrast.', '2007-06-12 16:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773543, 528411, 67697, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice setup, great colors!</td>', 'Good idea, nice setup, great colors!', '2007-06-12 16:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3773547, 527354, 67697, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the rock to make it pop out a little in the pic.  The whole pic is gorgeous - love the setting.</td>', 'Nice job on the rock to make it pop out a little in the pic.  The whole pic is gorgeous - love the setting.', '2007-06-12 16:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
