(3773905, 527824, 76198, '<td valign="top">Very curious about this one - what''s the moving light? Was the yellow light moving somehow? Looks like a UFO landing. Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very curious about this one - what''s the moving light? Was the yellow light moving somehow? Looks like a UFO landing. Very nice capture.', '2007-06-12 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
