(3774982, 528846, 61971, '<td valign="top">Hello, Imo your picture is dnmc. I feel this way because your light appears to be stationary. Outside of the challenge the composition is good, and the picture is sharp. I think the greying of some of the pettles in the middle are a little distracting. jmo. wish you luck. In challenge I am giving a 3, outside of challenge I would have given it a 6.</td>', 'Hello, Imo your picture is dnmc. I feel this way because your light appears to be stationary. Outside of the challenge the composition is good, and the picture is sharp. I think the greying of some of the pettles in the middle are a little distracting. jmo. wish you luck. In challenge I am giving a 3, outside of challenge I would have given it a 6.', '2007-06-12 22:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775001, 528390, 61971, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo. I like the light on the right side as well. It really makes you picture a couldron with smoke billowing over the edge. I can''t decide If I would have preffered the glass piece to be head on or not. :) jmo. 6 will be going back through for bumps later though.</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo. I like the light on the right side as well. It really makes you picture a couldron with smoke billowing over the edge. I can''t decide If I would have preffered the glass piece to be head on or not. :) jmo. 6 will be going back through for bumps later though.', '2007-06-12 22:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
