(3775033, 529299, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photo. I feel a stronger composition would have been with space to the left and no space to the right of the vase. But then you would loose the marks on the wall that suggest the light was in fact painted onto the flower. Nice focus. 6</td>', 'Very beautiful photo. I feel a stronger composition would have been with space to the left and no space to the right of the vase. But then you would loose the marks on the wall that suggest the light was in fact painted onto the flower. Nice focus. 6', '2007-06-12 22:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775042, 525042, 61971, '<td valign="top">Imo, this would have been stronger if both light sources were from the white sparkly kind. It would have solidified a volcano shape and the sparks being the eruption. The yellow mass on the right for me is distracting. The pin points of sprays from the light part really give it some sizzle. Wish you luck :) 6</td>', 'Imo, this would have been stronger if both light sources were from the white sparkly kind. It would have solidified a volcano shape and the sparks being the eruption. The yellow mass on the right for me is distracting. The pin points of sprays from the light part really give it some sizzle. Wish you luck :) 6', '2007-06-12 22:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775049, 529092, 61971, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful flower shot. Would look really good in black and white, with the contrast bumped up a bit. As a regular picture I would vote this a 6 or 7. IMO it dnmc though because the light source appears to be stationary to me. Because of this my challenge vote will be a 4.</td>', 'Very beautiful flower shot. Would look really good in black and white, with the contrast bumped up a bit. As a regular picture I would vote this a 6 or 7. IMO it dnmc though because the light source appears to be stationary to me. Because of this my challenge vote will be a 4.', '2007-06-12 22:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
