(3775618, 525909, 54540, '<td valign="top">I like the idea on this shot, but for me the problem is the focal point.<br/>With such a tight focus, I would like to see the focus on the base of the glass, or perhaps the opening.  Really the base though, as that''s where the brightest lighting is.  (my two cents)</td>', 'I like the idea on this shot, but for me the problem is the focal point.With such a tight focus, I would like to see the focus on the base of the glass, or perhaps the opening.  Really the base though, as that''s where the brightest lighting is.  (my two cents)', '2007-06-13 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775638, 528601, 61961, '<td valign="top">Creative image and a high score from me.  Maybe a little overblow on the t-shirt, but considering the difficulty of lighting in this challenge, it''s forgiveable.  The skin tones are great as is the sharpness.  Funny, this was the first (upper left) image in my random assortment of thumbnails.  I really liked it and have maintained my high opinion even after viewing 242 images.</td>', 'Creative image and a high score from me.  Maybe a little overblow on the t-shirt, but considering the difficulty of lighting in this challenge, it''s forgiveable.  The skin tones are great as is the sharpness.  Funny, this was the first (upper left) image in my random assortment of thumbnails.  I really liked it and have maintained my high opinion even after viewing 242 images.', '2007-06-13 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775660, 528482, 54540, '<td valign="top">Friggin'' awesome!  I laughed when I compared the title to the image.  WELL DONE and I wish all the best in the challenge!  The colors of the graffiti in the background are a fantastic addition.  I like everything about this shot.  One of my picks at the top.<br/>PS - Shouldn''t it be, "Ball of Fire"?</td>', 'Friggin'' awesome!  I laughed when I compared the title to the image.  WELL DONE and I wish all the best in the challenge!  The colors of the graffiti in the background are a fantastic addition.  I like everything about this shot.  One of my picks at the top.PS - Shouldn''t it be, "Ball of Fire"?', '2007-06-13 00:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3775758, 529311, 72774, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I''d love to see the light lit up.  I think it would add a lot.</td>', 'Nice.  I''d love to see the light lit up.  I think it would add a lot.', '2007-06-13 00:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
