(3780557, 528905, 79777, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this photo and how the light shines through the petals on the left</td>', 'I like the colors in this photo and how the light shines through the petals on the left', '2007-06-13 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780563, 529084, 50205, '<td valign="top">cool!</td>', 'cool!', '2007-06-13 23:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780584, 529221, 50205, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2007-06-13 23:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780632, 529239, 35352, '<td valign="top">very nice. I like the small bit of grass that you can see - the strip of green goes nicely with the blue wall. I like the 2 spotlights on the wall - it increases the interest level. I''m not sure about the actual blue colour - I''d prefer a slightly different colour, especially whole the green and cyan colours are great! There''s also a cropping issue - the top right of the building is right on the top border and theres a little too much black down the bottom. Great job!</td>', 'very nice. I like the small bit of grass that you can see - the strip of green goes nicely with the blue wall. I like the 2 spotlights on the wall - it increases the interest level. I''m not sure about the actual blue colour - I''d prefer a slightly different colour, especially whole the green and cyan colours are great! There''s also a cropping issue - the top right of the building is right on the top border and theres a little too much black down the bottom. Great job!', '2007-06-13 23:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780643, 525888, 35352, '<td valign="top">Mastery! Great painting with light. I really makes the photo interesting.</td>', 'Mastery! Great painting with light. I really makes the photo interesting.', '2007-06-13 23:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780649, 528482, 25678, '<td valign="top">You need to patch your pants. They are looking a little ragged :P<br/> <br/>nice shot, btw!</td>', 'You need to patch your pants. They are looking a little ragged :P nice shot, btw!', '2007-06-13 23:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780652, 528684, 35352, '<td valign="top">the light level here is a bit low. This think this needs something else to make it a bit more interesting.</td>', 'the light level here is a bit low. This think this needs something else to make it a bit more interesting.', '2007-06-13 23:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780661, 527163, 35352, '<td valign="top">a bit too dark. I''m guessing this is made out of glass and most the light is passed straight through - not reflected back to the camera.</td>', 'a bit too dark. I''m guessing this is made out of glass and most the light is passed straight through - not reflected back to the camera.', '2007-06-13 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780675, 527207, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo, I wish I was there. It does need some more contrast - make those blacks blacker. The sun was stationary during your capture so I don''t think this meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a great photo, I wish I was there. It does need some more contrast - make those blacks blacker. The sun was stationary during your capture so I don''t think this meets the challenge.', '2007-06-13 23:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780682, 527777, 35352, '<td valign="top">A remarkable photo! Even without the light writing, the night photo is terrific! I love the spotlights of light - there''s subtle yet create interest. It''s nicely framed - except maybe that shadow on the right and the white thing in the bottom left corner. The writing is magnificent. It really fits the challenge and looks great! I do wish you had made full use of the 640 pixels!</td>', 'A remarkable photo! Even without the light writing, the night photo is terrific! I love the spotlights of light - there''s subtle yet create interest. It''s nicely framed - except maybe that shadow on the right and the white thing in the bottom left corner. The writing is magnificent. It really fits the challenge and looks great! I do wish you had made full use of the 640 pixels!', '2007-06-13 23:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780688, 526939, 35352, '<td valign="top">very creative! nice timing to capture this photo. I really prefer the bottom half of the photo compared to the top - I don''t think the top adds anything. In fact, the blurry blur and dark objects are distracting.</td>', 'very creative! nice timing to capture this photo. I really prefer the bottom half of the photo compared to the top - I don''t think the top adds anything. In fact, the blurry blur and dark objects are distracting.', '2007-06-13 23:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780692, 528502, 35352, '<td valign="top">the phone movt has created an interesting pattern. The phone itself however is blurry and I can''t see the incoming call and text message.</td>', 'the phone movt has created an interesting pattern. The phone itself however is blurry and I can''t see the incoming call and text message.', '2007-06-13 23:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780856, 529184, 77397, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit too much - distracts from the subject for me.</td>', 'it''s a bit too much - distracts from the subject for me.', '2007-06-14 00:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780873, 528821, 77397, '<td valign="top">very creative - excellent capture of expressing motion. I think a colored tee or a black ee would have been a way to isolate the ball that much more. nice job--</td>', 'very creative - excellent capture of expressing motion. I think a colored tee or a black ee would have been a way to isolate the ball that much more. nice job--', '2007-06-14 00:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780878, 529151, 77397, '<td valign="top">very very nice. really makes a soft presentation---</td>', 'very very nice. really makes a soft presentation---', '2007-06-14 00:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3780888, 526428, 77397, '<td valign="top">I love it - perfectly cropped and in focus- wow</td>', 'I love it - perfectly cropped and in focus- wow', '2007-06-14 00:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
