(3780933, 528537, 60862, '<td valign="top">YIPPEEEEE!!!!  Congrats on your new personal best and welcome to the 6+ club, Susan. :)  What a creative idea to use the sparks to light up the background.</td>', 'YIPPEEEEE!!!!  Congrats on your new personal best and welcome to the 6+ club, Susan. :)  What a creative idea to use the sparks to light up the background.', '2007-06-14 01:09:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(3780937, 529208, 63830, '<td valign="top">Ok, you have to tell us how you did this. You are going to tell us aren''t you? I thought it was the coolest one of the bunch.</td>', 'Ok, you have to tell us how you did this. You are going to tell us aren''t you? I thought it was the coolest one of the bunch.', '2007-06-14 01:10:19.000000', NULL, 0),
