(3780981, 528693, 60862, '<td valign="top">You pulled it off!  I''ve so badly wanted to do a shot like this (Seeker''s shot has bee in my faves for a long time), but my own experiments showed what you mention - that painting parallel lines is very, very hard.  Can you describe your invention a little more?<br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon and executing this so well!</td>', 'You pulled it off!  I''ve so badly wanted to do a shot like this (Seeker''s shot has bee in my faves for a long time), but my own experiments showed what you mention - that painting parallel lines is very, very hard.  Can you describe your invention a little more? Congrats on the ribbon and executing this so well!', '2007-06-14 01:15:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3780994, 526878, 67841, '<td valign="top">Well, you''re no stranger to the top ten club, but I''m very pleased to see that this one made it there!  <br/> <br/>It''s an excellent piece of work and I knew it would do well - congrats!</td>', 'Well, you''re no stranger to the top ten club, but I''m very pleased to see that this one made it there!   It''s an excellent piece of work and I knew it would do well - congrats!', '2007-06-14 01:16:46.000000', NULL, 0),
