(3781105, 529287, 76198, '<td valign="top">Those old Gibson tailpieces sure are a pain, ain''t they? Lovely shot, beautiful mandos, and congrats on a personal best. What''s the one in the back?</td>', 'Those old Gibson tailpieces sure are a pain, ain''t they? Lovely shot, beautiful mandos, and congrats on a personal best. What''s the one in the back?', '2007-06-14 01:32:07.000000', NULL, 0),
