(3781132, 528196, 60495, '<td valign="top">I totally agree the title is horrible, thanks for the comments hopefully the photo was not as bad as the title...lol</td>', 'I totally agree the title is horrible, thanks for the comments hopefully the photo was not as bad as the title...lol', '2007-06-14 01:34:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781157, 529132, 53964, '<td valign="top">I was away so didn''t get to voting but, yes, I''m a wacko who digs it.<br/> <br/>It''s an arachnophobic''s nightmare, the spider looking ghostly and still vividly, menacingly real. Is the mesh protecting or caging the prey?<br/> <br/>The optical illusion at the junctures of the mesh add to the dream feeling, bringing in an element that is visible from the corner of the eye, then disappearing on direct viewing.<br/> <br/>Yup, I''d hang it on my wall! :D</td>', 'I was away so didn''t get to voting but, yes, I''m a wacko who digs it. It''s an arachnophobic''s nightmare, the spider looking ghostly and still vividly, menacingly real. Is the mesh protecting or caging the prey? The optical illusion at the junctures of the mesh add to the dream feeling, bringing in an element that is visible from the corner of the eye, then disappearing on direct viewing. Yup, I''d hang it on my wall! :D', '2007-06-14 01:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781195, 525640, 65025, '<td valign="top">Alice!  This shot did so awesome!  Good job!</td>', 'Alice!  This shot did so awesome!  Good job!', '2007-06-14 01:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3781207, 528363, 67237, '<td valign="top">I am also very sorry about Kasper.<br/>Congratulations for the this great image and the good score!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-14 00:43:45.</i></td>', 'I am also very sorry about Kasper.Congratulations for the this great image and the good score!!', '2007-06-14 01:41:23.000000', '2007-06-14 01:43:45.000000', 0),
