(3840574, 526659, 80555, '<td valign="top">An amazing effort, breathtaking actually. I was blown away by the sparks and the teapot! I wonder what is in the teapot, is it tea or coffee? Some people perfer coffee, other tea and apparently other people like yourself perfer sparks!<br/> <br/>This photo has breathtaking shadows and hues along with a beautiful gradient from the darkness to the lightness of the sparkles. Good effort, I would be more impressed if it were a beer bottle instead of the teapot!</td>', 'An amazing effort, breathtaking actually. I was blown away by the sparks and the teapot! I wonder what is in the teapot, is it tea or coffee? Some people perfer coffee, other tea and apparently other people like yourself perfer sparks! This photo has breathtaking shadows and hues along with a beautiful gradient from the darkness to the lightness of the sparkles. Good effort, I would be more impressed if it were a beer bottle instead of the teapot!', '2007-06-27 07:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
