(3920952, 526659, 30456, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is pretty good just the way you set it up. I don''t think there is much more you need to do to "save the shot" with post processing.  I think this shot was quite successful.  I would be more inclined to continue experiments using variations of pyrotechniks, reflective sources and subjects or combinations of subjects.  This shot has certainly given me some inspiration.</td>', 'I think this shot is pretty good just the way you set it up. I don''t think there is much more you need to do to "save the shot" with post processing.  I think this shot was quite successful.  I would be more inclined to continue experiments using variations of pyrotechniks, reflective sources and subjects or combinations of subjects.  This shot has certainly given me some inspiration.', '2007-07-20 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
