(4321010, 529107, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! My only complaint here is that nothing is really black in the photo, making the contrast feel a little washed out. perhaps some burning at the edges of the darkest shadows might enhance the tones. Or even an adjustment in levels might work. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'Fabulous! My only complaint here is that nothing is really black in the photo, making the contrast feel a little washed out. perhaps some burning at the edges of the darkest shadows might enhance the tones. Or even an adjustment in levels might work. Just a thought. :)', '2007-12-18 16:45:42.000000', NULL, 0),
