(6438726, 528363, 120129, '<td valign="top">I know this work is a few years old, but I stumbled on it today. Your photo caught my eye because I am always drawn to the sea and saw something emotional in your work and wanted to read what you had to say. I had to stop several times to wipe my eyes before I could go on. Our beloved cocker spaniel Daisy is 15 and that bullet is headed our way. She is a sailing dog and your tribute to Kasper touched me deeply. Thank you for the beautiful work and words, but most of all for sharing when you were vulnerable. Lauri</td>', 'I know this work is a few years old, but I stumbled on it today. Your photo caught my eye because I am always drawn to the sea and saw something emotional in your work and wanted to read what you had to say. I had to stop several times to wipe my eyes before I could go on. Our beloved cocker spaniel Daisy is 15 and that bullet is headed our way. She is a sailing dog and your tribute to Kasper touched me deeply. Thank you for the beautiful work and words, but most of all for sharing when you were vulnerable. Lauri', '2011-06-08 15:29:52.000000', NULL, 0);
